from applicable law or a separately stated licence.

The repository also contains source-derived data and other material from
third-party publishers. Project FINER does not claim ownership of that source
material and does not grant rights on behalf of those publishers. Public
availability is not, by itself, permission to reuse or redistribute it.

Any licence attached to a specific upstream source applies only according to
its own terms and scope. It does not automatically apply to the entire
repository or release. Review the source-by-source rights metadata at
https://projectfiner.com/data-rights/ before reuse.

This temporary notice is intentionally conservative while code ownership and
upstream data terms are reviewed. A future licence decision must be explicit
and must not be inferred from repository visibility or public download links.
